clustine-light

Parts of this crate are adapted from SteelMC
(https://github.com/Steel-Foundation/SteelMC), branch 26.3 at commit
885c4b3e60ed79862c37311780774f76806cb714, which is licensed under the GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3. Each adapted file says in its first comment which
files of SteelMC it is adapted from. What is adapted are the rules of light (what a
block gives and takes, when two faces stop light, where the sky comes straight down),
not SteelMC's queues, caches, storage or threading. The adaptations are licensed as
the rest of Clustine is, AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Nothing of the official server's worlds is in this crate: the comparison in
tests/official.rs reads a world from a directory it is given.
